  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "uhly-a-kruznice",
      "title": "Ze stupňů na kružnici",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
          "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
          "page": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
          "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
          "page": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
          "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
          "page": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
          "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
          "page": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
          "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
          "page": 14
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Plná otočka má 360° = 2π rad. Ze stupňů na radiány převádíme násobením π/180; opačně násobením 180/π. Proto 30° = π/6, 45° = π/4, 60° = π/3 a 90° = π/2.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 5
            },
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 6
            },
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 12
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Bod na jednotkové kružnici má souřadnice [cos x; sin x]. Kosinus je vodorovná souřadnice a sinus svislá. Základní úhly rozšíříme do ostatních kvadrantů pomocí symetrií a znamének.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 8
            },
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 10
            },
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 12
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "key",
          "text": "Před výpočtem zkontroluj režim kalkulačky: DEG pro stupně, RAD pro radiány. Číslo π v argumentu není totéž jako 180 zadaných v radiánovém režimu.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 7
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "tan x = sin x / cos x vyžaduje cos x ≠ 0; cot x = cos x / sin x vyžaduje sin x ≠ 0. Například cot 0 není nekonečno jako hodnota funkce, ale nedefinovaný výraz.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
              "page": 14
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 19
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 20
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://github.com/hphugosm/study/releases/download/studylo-learning-v1/9e2a6e20b01d3d99b9d6b7778da83ac8f925fee12e40d52a83e6a731ae71aa90.webp",
          "alt": "Jednotková kružnice se základními úhly a souřadnicemi",
          "caption": "Trigonometrie, snímek 8: hodnoty čti jako vodorovnou a svislou souřadnici.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "2822b649b9e2891e1fe3b9e8c8f511b376fcbf81fa898867b083eca92b8b4573",
              "sha256": "3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054",
