            }
          ],
          "source_media": "extracted/3c83034105c5de3c32749473a3bd388522d96b4b48e2d8eb1bc568557967a054/media/slide-008-preview.png",
          "width": 1400,
          "height": 788
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Převádíš stupně a radiány a z jednotkové kružnice odečítáš sinus, kosinus i jejich znaménka v kvadrantech."
    },
    {
      "id": "grafy-a-promeny",
      "title": "Odděl změnu výšky od změny periody",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
          "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
          "page": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
          "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
          "page": 9
        },
        {
          "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
          "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
          "page": 11
        },
        {
          "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
          "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
          "page": 13
        },
        {
          "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
          "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
          "page": 19
        },
        {
          "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
          "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "978dfc6ee7c589de65235f878d11faf5ad3d7ee8d0682a7bcc2fd4cd66b2d886",
          "sha256": "271265b365a5cd1d499dbdd71c1a4d87f0e07b61e2ec168da18233b5a324e761",
          "page": 1
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Pro y = a·f(b(x − c)) + d při a ≠ 0 a b ≠ 0 mění a svislé měřítko, d svislý posun, b vodorovné měřítko a c posun po ose x. Záporné a navíc převrátí graf kolem osy x.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 9
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 11
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 13
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Sinus a kosinus mají základní periodu 2π; po změně argumentu je T = 2π/|b|.",
            "Tangens a kotangens mají základní periodu π; po změně argumentu je T = π/|b|.",
            "Pro sinus a kosinus je obor hodnot [d − |a|; d + |a|]."
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 7
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 15
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 19
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 20
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "key",
          "text": "Nejdřív vytkni koeficient argumentu: cos(2x + π) = cos(2(x + π/2)). Posun je doleva o π/2, ne o π.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 11
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "U tangens a kotangens navíc určujeme vyloučené body a svislé asymptoty. Pro zápis a·tan(b(x − c)) + d jsou x = c + (π/2 + kπ)/b; u cot je x = c + kπ/b, kde k ∈ ℤ.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "978dfc6ee7c589de65235f878d11faf5ad3d7ee8d0682a7bcc2fd4cd66b2d886",
              "sha256": "271265b365a5cd1d499dbdd71c1a4d87f0e07b61e2ec168da18233b5a324e761",
              "page": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 23
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://github.com/hphugosm/study/releases/download/studylo-learning-v1/64f69a71511b14d566dc09b8ff23d889c4e134465e55fb217f34acb2e8093411.webp",
          "alt": "Zadání a rozklad transformace y = 2sin(2x + π/2) − 3",
          "caption": "Grafy, snímek 13: všimni si vytažení dvojky před určením posunu.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 13
            }
          ],
          "source_media": "extracted/16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68/media/slide-013-preview.png",
          "width": 1400,
          "height": 788
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "title": "Uprav argument",
          "text": "y = 2sin(2x + π/2) − 3 = 2sin(2(x + π/4)) − 3.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 13
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Přečti parametry",
          "text": "a = 2, b = 2, c = −π/4, d = −3.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 13
            },
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 14
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Urči periodu a obor hodnot",
          "text": "T = 2π/2 = π; H = [−3 − 2; −3 + 2] = [−5; −1]. Definiční obor je ℝ.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "274e5c9b1521098ce00183bc99b9479f20829597dc608f35dd2ef88991c4b53f",
              "sha256": "16e1d4263fc64eff7681a79d747dc36bc3f0997079ba79c40b632e14a741dc68",
              "page": 15
